pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: 品牌故事：2016 年创立于武夷山天心村，十年坚持山场直采、大师监制、当季上市。
elements:
  - elementId: header-mark
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 38, 14, 14]
    shapeName: custom
    viewBox: [100, 100]
    path: "M0,0 H100 V100 H0 Z M10,10 V90 H90 V10 Z M46,10 H54 V90 H46 Z M10,46 H90 V54 H10 Z"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: header-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 34, 240, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$muted"
      letterSpacing: 3
      text: "壹 · 品牌故事"

  - elementId: header-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [612, 34, 300, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$muted"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [right, top]
      text: "一盏山河 · 年度发布会"

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 62, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 88, 480, 50]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama DongFangDaKai"
      fontSize: 34
      color: "$primary"
      text: "以山为师，以茶为信"

  - elementId: page-sub
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 142, 480, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "zcoolwenyiti"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$muted"
      text: "从武夷山一间茶室，到二十七家城市门店"

  - elementId: story-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 186, 470, 140]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      text: |
        <p>2016 年，山茗集在武夷山天心村创立。第一年只做一件事：跟着老师傅走遍三坑两涧，把「正岩山场」的标准立起来。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">十年间，从武夷岩茶到西湖龙井，再到云南凤庆的古树滇红。我们坚持山场直采、大师监制、当季上市，把每一座茶山的本味，原封不动地端上城市茶桌。</p>

  - elementId: quote-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 340, 3, 46]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: quote-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [62, 338, 320, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "zcoolwenyiti"
      fontSize: 17
      color: "$primary"
      text: "茶者，人在草木间。"

  - elementId: quote-src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [62, 366, 320, 18]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: "—— 山茗集创立手记 · 2016"

  - elementId: garden-image
    elementType: image
    bounds: [540, 88, 372, 248]
    src: "media/wuyi-tea-garden.png"
    fit: {mode: cover}

  - elementId: garden-lattice
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [552, 292, 32, 32]
    shapeName: custom
    viewBox: [100, 100]
    path: "M0,0 H100 V100 H0 Z M10,10 V90 H90 V10 Z M46,10 H54 V90 H46 Z M10,46 H90 V54 H10 Z"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: garden-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 344, 372, 18]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, top]
      text: "福建 · 武夷山 三坑两涧 正岩核心产区"

  - elementId: timeline-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 451, 858, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}

  - elementId: tl-node-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 449, 6, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: tl-node-2
